    <bpmn:process id="W_W1563" name="W1563. Store Energy Management, Electricity Consumption Monitoring, HVAC Optimization &amp; Utility Cost Reduction Program" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly utility cost review cycle; or store electricity cost exceeding PHP 200,000/month threshold; or annual sustainability review per W497; or new store construction design phase
Frequency: Monthly utility bill review; quarterly energy audit; annual optimization program review
Volume: 200 stores + 4 DCs + HQ; total annual electricity cost: ~PHP 400–600M (~PHP 150–300K/store/month); HVAC accounts for ~40–50% of store electricity consumption
Owner: Facilities Manager
Participants: Facilities Manager, Sustainability Officer, Store Manager, CFO, COO, External Energy Auditor, MERALCO/Local Electric Cooperative
Source: workflow W1563 — Store Energy Management, Electricity Consumption Monitoring, HVAC Optimization &amp; Utility Cost Reduction Program</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1563_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1563_Lane1" name="Facilities Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1563_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1563_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1563_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1563_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1563_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1563_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1563_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1563_Start3" name="Monthly utility cost review cycle; or store electricity cost exceeding PHP 200,000/month…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1563_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1563_Task4" name="Monthly utility bill review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monthly utility bill review: Facilities Manager reviews electricity bills for all 200 stores: (a) cost per store vs. prior month and same month prior year; (b) cost per sqm (PHP/sqm/month) — normalize for store size; (c) consumption per sqm (kWh/sqm/month); (d) identify outliers: stores with &gt; 20% increase month-over-month or &gt; 15% above chain average; (e) investigate outliers: (i) meter reading error, (ii) rate increase by utility, (iii) HVAC malfunction (running 24/7 due to thermostat failure), (iv) operational change (extended hours, new equipment)
Responsible (R): Facilities Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 4 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1563_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1563_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1563_Task5" name="HVAC optimization program">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: HVAC optimization program: Facilities Manager implements HVAC efficiency measures: (a) thermostat standardization: all stores set to 24°C (DOLE-recommended range: 23–26°C for worker comfort); (b) scheduled maintenance per manufacturer intervals: filter cleaning (monthly), coil cleaning (quarterly), refrigerant check (semi-annually); (c) variable speed drive (VSD) installation on HVAC fans: reduces energy consumption by 20–30% during partial-load operation; (d) programmable thermostats with scheduling: reduce cooling during non-store hours (night, early morning), pre-cool before opening; (e) target: reduce HVAC energy consumption by 15–20% through optimization measures
Responsible (R): Facilities Manager / HVAC Contractor
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 8 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1563_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1563_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1563_Task6" name="LED lighting retrofit tracking">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: LED lighting retrofit tracking: Track ongoing LED retrofit across store portfolio: (a) convert remaining fluorescent and HID fixtures to LED (LED uses 50–70% less electricity); (b) prioritize stores with highest lighting energy consumption; (c) track retrofit status: completed stores vs. pending; (d) ROI: LED retrofit payback period 12–18 months; (e) for new stores per W702: LED lighting as standard specification
Responsible (R): Facilities Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1563_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1563_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1563_Task7" name="Annual energy audit">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Annual energy audit: Facilities Manager conducts (or contracts) annual energy audit for top 20 energy-consuming stores: (a) on-site inspection: HVAC efficiency, lighting audit, insulation assessment, air leakage detection, equipment power draw measurement; (b) identify specific energy-saving opportunities per store with cost-benefit analysis; (c) compile energy audit report with prioritized recommendations ranked by payback period; (d) CFO approves capital investments for recommended improvements per W21
Responsible (R): Facilities Manager / External Energy Auditor
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 40 hours/year (2 hours/store × 20 stores)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1563_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1563_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1563_Task8" name="Quarterly energy performance reporting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Quarterly energy performance reporting: Facilities Manager reports to COO and Sustainability Officer: (a) chain-wide electricity cost and consumption trend; (b) average cost per sqm vs. target (benchmark: PHP 15–20/sqm/month for Philippine big-box retail); (c) HVAC optimization program progress; (d) LED retrofit completion percentage; (e) energy savings vs. baseline year; (f) carbon footprint from electricity consumption per store (kWh × Philippine grid emission factor ~0.7 kg CO2/kWh); (g) contribution to BuildRight&#x27;s corporate emissions reduction target per W497
Responsible (R): Facilities Manager / Sustainability Officer
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 4 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1563_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1563_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1563_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1563_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1563_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-303 (ensure controlled execution — Facility Maintenance &amp; Equipment (PA-20.3).) | - operational: Facilities Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Facilities Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1563_Assoc11" sourceRef="W1563_Annotation10" targetRef="W1563_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
